#. type: Title ==
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:52
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "简介"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:55
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This chapter outlines accessibility features available in graphical desktop "
"environments designed for users with low vision, such as virtual magnifiers, "
"easy-to-read fonts, and screen scaling."
msgstr "本章概述了为低视力用户设计的图形桌面环境中提供的无障碍功能，例如虚拟放大镜、易读字体和屏幕缩放。"

#. type: Title ==
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:57
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Desktop Size"
msgstr "桌面尺寸"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:61
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Graphical environments allow users to adjust the desktop display size, a "
"feature commonly known as screen scaling or HiDPI scaling.  The goal is to "
"enlarge desktop elements such as icons, text, and windows to improve "
"visibility and accessibility."
msgstr "图形环境允许用户调整桌面的显示尺寸，此功能通常称为屏幕缩放或 HiDPI 缩放。其目的是放大图标、文本和窗口等桌面元素，以提高可见性和无障碍性。"

#. type: Title ====
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:63
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:109
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:344
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:394
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "KDE Plasma"
msgstr "KDE Plasma"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:66
#, fuzzy
msgid "Open the `_Display Configuration_` module:"
msgstr "打开 __Display Configuration__ 模块："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:70
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "% kcmshell6 kcm_kscreen\n"
msgstr "% kcmshell6 kcm_kscreen\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:74
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Select the scaling via the `_Global Scale_` bar.  The change will take "
"effect after a KDE Plasma restart."
msgstr "通过 __Global Scale__ 栏选择缩放比例。重启 KDE Plasma 后，更改才会生效。"

#. type: Title ====
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:76
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:126
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:363
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:416
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "XFCE"
msgstr "XFCE"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:79
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"To set a custom scaling factor, for example 4, run the following command:"
msgstr "要设置自定义缩放比例（例如 4），请运行以下命令："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:83
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "% xfconf-query -c xsettings -p /Gdk/WindowScalingFactor -s 4\n"
msgstr "% xfconf-query -c xsettings -p /Gdk/WindowScalingFactor -s 4\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:88
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Alternatively, HiDPI scaling can be enabled with a fixed 2x factor using the "
"graphical interface.  This option is available in the `_Appearance_` dialog, "
"under the `_Settings_` tab as `_Window Scaling_`.  To open the "
"`_Appearance_` dialog, execute:"
msgstr "或者，也可以通过图形界面启用固定为 2 倍的 HiDPI 缩放。此选项位于 __Appearance__ 对话框的 __Settings__ 选项卡下，名称为 __Window Scaling__。要打开 __Appearance__ 对话框，请执行："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:92
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:159
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "% xfce4-appearance-settings\n"
msgstr "% xfce4-appearance-settings\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:95
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Font"
msgstr "字体"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:100
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The package:x11-fonts/atkinson-hyperlegible[] provides the _atkinson-"
"hyperlegible_ font.  It is designed for good readability, the letter shapes "
"aim to increase character recognition.  To install, execute:"
msgstr "package:x11-fonts/atkinson-hyperlegible[] 软件包提供 _atkinson-hyperlegible_ 字体。该字体旨在提高可读性，其字形设计力求提升字符辨识度。要安装它，请执行："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:104
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# pkg install atkinson-hyperlegible\n"
msgstr "# pkg install atkinson-hyperlegible\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:107
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The remainder of this section describes how to set up fonts in various "
"graphical environments using _atkinson-hyperlegible_ as an example."
msgstr "本节其余部分将以 _atkinson-hyperlegible_ 为例，介绍如何在各种图形环境中设置字体。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:113
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"KDE allows selecting a font and its size via the `_Fonts_` module.  Run:"
msgstr "KDE 允许通过 __Fonts__ 模块选择字体及其大小。运行："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:117
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "% kcmshell6 kcm_fonts\n"
msgstr "% kcmshell6 kcm_fonts\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:121
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Click on the Adjust `_All Fonts..._` button to select the font and its size "
"for all graphical elements.  Alternatively, you can choose the font and size "
"for individual elements using the forms below."
msgstr "单击 Adjust __All Fonts...__ 按钮，为所有图形元素选择字体及其大小。或者，也可以使用下方的表单为各个元素分别选择字体和大小。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:124
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"At the bottom of the window, you can also select options such as `_Anti-"
"Aliasing_`, `_Sub-pixel Rendering_`, `_Hinting_`, and `_Force Font DPI_`.  "
"Each option has an icon on the right to open a help dialog."
msgstr "在窗口底部，还可以选择 __Anti-Aliasing__、__Sub-pixel Rendering__、__Hinting__ 和 __Force Font DPI__ 等选项。每个选项右侧都有一个图标，单击即可打开帮助对话框。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:129
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"XFCE allows you to select the font and size for window titles and content "
"text, as well as the font size for icon labels."
msgstr "XFCE 允许为窗口标题和内容文本选择字体及大小，也允许设置图标标签的字体大小。"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:137
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"% xfconf-query -c xfwm4 -p /general/title_font -s \"Atkinson Hyperlegible 15\" <1>\n"
"% xfconf-query -c xsettings -p /Gtk/FontName -s \"Atkinson Hyperlegible 15\" <2>\n"
"% xfconf-query -c xsettings -p /Gtk/MonospaceFontName -s \"Atkinson Hyperlegible 15\" <3>\n"
"% xfconf-query -c xfce4-desktop -p /desktop-icons/use-custom-font-size -s true <4>\n"
"% xfconf-query -c xfce4-desktop -p /desktop-icons/font-size -s 15.0 <5>\n"
msgstr "% xfconf-query -c xfwm4 -p /general/title_font -s \"Atkinson Hyperlegible 15\" <1>\n% xfconf-query -c xsettings -p /Gtk/FontName -s \"Atkinson Hyperlegible 15\" <2>\n% xfconf-query -c xsettings -p /Gtk/MonospaceFontName -s \"Atkinson Hyperlegible 15\" <3>\n% xfconf-query -c xfce4-desktop -p /desktop-icons/use-custom-font-size -s true <4>\n% xfconf-query -c xfce4-desktop -p /desktop-icons/font-size -s 15.0 <5>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:140
#, fuzzy
msgid "Set the window title font to _Atkinson Hyperlegible_, size 15."
msgstr "将窗口标题字体设为 _Atkinson Hyperlegible_，大小为 15。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:141
#, fuzzy
msgid "Set the window content font to _Atkinson Hyperlegible_, size 15."
msgstr "将窗口内容字体设为 _Atkinson Hyperlegible_，大小为 15。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:142
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Set the monospace font within windows to _Atkinson Hyperlegible_, size 15."
msgstr "将窗口内的等宽字体设为 _Atkinson Hyperlegible_，大小为 15。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:143
#, fuzzy
msgid "Enable custom font sizing for icons."
msgstr "为图标启用自定义字体大小。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:144
#, fuzzy
msgid "Set the icon font size to 15.0."
msgstr "将图标字体大小设为 15.0。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:146
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Alternatively, you can configure the same settings using the graphical XFCE "
"configuration dialogs."
msgstr "或者，也可以使用 XFCE 图形配置对话框设置相同选项。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:148
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"To select the font for window titles, open the `_Window Manager_` dialog:"
msgstr "要为窗口标题选择字体，请打开 __Window Manager__ 对话框："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:152
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "% xfwm4-settings\n"
msgstr "% xfwm4-settings\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:155
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"To choose the font used inside windows, open the `_Appearance_` dialog and "
"go to the `_Fonts_` tab:"
msgstr "要选择窗口内使用的字体，请打开 __Appearance__ 对话框并转到 __Fonts__ 选项卡："

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:165
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"In the Fonts tab, you can also adjust options such as `_anti-aliasing_`, "
"`_Hinting_`, `_Sub-pixel order_`, and `_Custom DPI_`.  For more details, see "
"the https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-settings/appearance#fonts[XFCE "
"documentation]."
msgstr "在 Fonts 选项卡中，还可以调整 __anti-aliasing__、__Hinting__、__Sub-pixel order__ 和 __Custom DPI__ 等选项。详情请参阅 link:https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-settings/appearance#fonts[XFCE 文档]。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:168
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"To set the font size for icons, open the `_Desktop_` dialog and go to the "
"`_Desktop Icons_` tab where you can adjust the icon font size:"
msgstr "要设置图标的字体大小，请打开 __Desktop__ 对话框并转到 __Desktop Icons__ 选项卡，然后即可调整图标字体大小："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:172
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "% xfdesktop-settings\n"
msgstr "% xfdesktop-settings\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:175
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Magnify"
msgstr "放大"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:180
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This section describes various utilities that magnify portions of the "
"screen, acting as virtual magnifying lenses.  Some tools continuously "
"enlarge the area beneath the mouse cursor, while others do not.  Certain "
"utilities automatically move the magnified window to follow the cursor, "
"whereas others keep it fixed in place."
msgstr "本节介绍了多种用于放大屏幕局部区域、充当虚拟放大镜的工具。有些工具会持续放大鼠标光标下方的区域，有些则不会。有些工具会自动移动放大窗口以跟随光标，有些则将窗口固定在原处。"

