#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:214
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The rest of this section details the steps to install, configure, and launch "
"the utilities."
msgstr "本节其余部分将详细介绍如何安装、配置和启动这些工具。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:220
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The man:lupe[1] utility is a screen magnifier for the X Window System that "
"updates the magnified area in real time.  To install it, run:"
msgstr "man:lupe[1] 工具是适用于 X Window System 的屏幕放大工具，可实时更新放大区域。要安装它，请运行："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:224
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# pkg install lupe\n"
msgstr "# pkg install lupe\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:228
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"By default, lupe magnifies the screen content beneath the mouse pointer "
"within a circular area (25×25 pixels) displayed at the center of the "
"screen.  To start lupe, run:"
msgstr "默认情况下，lupe 会放大鼠标指针下方的屏幕内容，并在屏幕中央的圆形区域（25×25 像素）中显示。要启动 lupe，请运行："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:232
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "% lupe\n"
msgstr "% lupe\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:235
#, fuzzy
msgid "To exit lupe, press the `q` key."
msgstr "要退出 lupe，请按 `q` 键。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:240
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Start lupe with the `-noshape` option to display the magnified area in a "
"separate, movable window.  Without this option, the magnifier is locked to "
"the center of the screen."
msgstr "使用 `-noshape` 选项启动 lupe，可在独立且可移动的窗口中显示放大区域。不使用此选项时，放大镜会固定在屏幕中央。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:247
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The man:kmag[1] utility provides a screen magnifier that displays a zoomed "
"view of the area under the mouse cursor in a dedicated window.  The "
"magnifier window includes a menu with various options and settings for "
"customization."
msgstr "man:kmag[1] 工具提供屏幕放大功能，可在专用窗口中显示鼠标光标下方区域的放大视图。放大镜窗口包含一个菜单，其中提供了各种自定义选项和设置。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:249
#, fuzzy
msgid "To install kmag, run:"
msgstr "要安装 kmag，请运行："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:253
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# pkg install kmag\n"
msgstr "# pkg install kmag\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:256
#, fuzzy
msgid "To launch kmag, execute:"
msgstr "要启动 kmag，请执行："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:260
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "% kmag\n"
msgstr "% kmag\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:267
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The package:x11/xlupe[] utility is a screen magnifier for the X Window "
"System that updates the magnified view in real time.  To install it, run:"
msgstr "package:x11/xlupe[] 工具是适用于 X Window System 的屏幕放大工具，可实时更新放大视图。要安装它，请运行："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:271
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# pkg install xlupe\n"
msgstr "# pkg install xlupe\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:274
#, fuzzy
msgid "To launch xlupe, execute:"
msgstr "要启动 xlupe，请执行："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:278
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "% xlupe\n"
msgstr "% xlupe\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:281
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The utility does not include a manual page, but it starts in a graphical "
"window with buttons that allow you to configure its options interactively."
msgstr "该工具没有手册页，但启动后会显示一个图形窗口，其中的按钮可用于交互式配置选项。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:287
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The man:xmag[1] utility is a basic screen magnifier for the X Window "
"System.  Unlike other magnifiers, it does not update the magnified area in "
"real time."
msgstr "man:xmag[1] 工具是适用于 X Window System 的基础屏幕放大工具。与其他放大工具不同，它不会实时更新放大区域。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:289
#, fuzzy
msgid "To install it, run:"
msgstr "要安装它，请运行："

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:291
#, fuzzy
msgid "To install, execute:"
msgstr "要安装，请执行："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:295
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# pkg install xmag\n"
msgstr "# pkg install xmag\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:298
#, fuzzy
msgid "To launch xmag, execute:"
msgstr "要启动 xmag，请执行："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:302
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "% mag\n"
msgstr "% mag\n"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:309
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"xmag does not display a magnified area immediately upon launch.  Click "
"anywhere on the screen with the left mouse button to select a region, and "
"xmag will open a window showing a magnified view of that area.  The "
"application window includes a few buttons offering limited functionality."
msgstr "xmag 启动后不会立即显示放大区域。单击屏幕任意位置以选取区域，xmag 随即会打开一个窗口，显示该区域的放大视图。应用程序窗口中有几个按钮，提供有限的功能。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:316
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The man:xzoom[1] utility is a screen magnifier for the X Window System that "
"updates the magnified view in real time.  To install it, run:"
msgstr "man:xzoom[1] 工具是适用于 X Window System 的屏幕放大工具，可实时更新放大视图。要安装它，请运行："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:320
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# pkg install xzoom\n"
msgstr "# pkg install xzoom\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:323
#, fuzzy
msgid "To launch xzoom, execute:"
msgstr "要启动 xzoom，请执行："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:327
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "% xzoom\n"
msgstr "% xzoom\n"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:333
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Unlike other magnifiers, xzoom does not automatically follow the mouse "
"cursor or magnify the area beneath it in its own window.  Interaction is "
"keyboard-driven, refer to man:xzoom[1] for available commands and usage "
"details."
msgstr "与其他放大工具不同，xzoom 不会自动跟随鼠标光标，也不会在自身窗口中放大光标下方的区域。它通过键盘操作，命令和用法详情请参阅 man:xzoom[1]。"

#. type: Title ==
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:336
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Mouse"
msgstr "鼠标"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:339
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Appearance"
msgstr "外观"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:342
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Some desktop environments allow you to change the size, color, and other "
"graphical properties of the mouse cursor."
msgstr "某些桌面环境允许更改鼠标光标的大小、颜色和其他图形属性。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:348
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"KDE Plasma provides the `_Cursors_` module to select the mouse cursor theme "
"and size.  To launch it, run:"
msgstr "KDE Plasma 提供 __Cursors__ 模块，可用于选择鼠标光标主题和大小。要启动该模块，请运行："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:352
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "% kcmshell6 kcm_cursortheme\n"
msgstr "% kcmshell6 kcm_cursortheme\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:357
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Select an installed cursor theme in the window.  There is a `_Size_` drop-"
"down menu in the top left corner to choose the mouse cursor size, available "
"sizes depend on the selected theme."
msgstr "在窗口中选择已安装的光标主题。左上角有一个 __Size__ 下拉菜单，可用于选择鼠标光标大小；可选大小取决于所选主题。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:361
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Click the `_Get New..._` icon in the top right corner to install a new "
"theme.  You can install new themes from the new window.  As a suggestion, "
"search for `_Large Mouse Cursors_`, a black and white high contrast theme."
msgstr "单击右上角的 __Get New...__ 图标可安装新主题。可以在新窗口中安装主题。建议搜索 __Large Mouse Cursors__，这是一个黑白高对比度主题。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:367
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"XFCE allows you to set the size and color of the mouse pointer via `_Mouse "
"and Touchpad_` dialog.  To run the dialog start:"
msgstr "XFCE 允许通过 __Mouse and Touchpad__ 对话框设置鼠标指针的大小和颜色。要打开该对话框，请启动："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:371
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "% xfce4-mouse-settings\n"
msgstr "% xfce4-mouse-settings\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:374
#, fuzzy
msgid "Then click on the `_Theme_` tab to select a size and a style."
msgstr "然后点击 __主题__ 选项卡，选择大小和样式。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:378
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Some themes, included the _Default_, do not support cursor size "
"customization."
msgstr "某些主题（包括 __默认__ 主题）不支持自定义光标大小。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:382
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Alternatively, you can achieve the same result via the `xfconf-query` "
"command.  The following example sets the current theme cursor to size 50:"
msgstr "或者，你也可以使用 `xfconf-query` 命令实现相同的效果。以下示例将当前主题的光标大小设置为 50："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:386
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "% xfconf-query -c xsettings -n -p /Gtk/CursorThemeSize -s 50\n"
msgstr "% xfconf-query -c xsettings -n -p /Gtk/CursorThemeSize -s 50\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:389
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Find Cursor"
msgstr "查找光标"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:392
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Some desktop environments provide visual feedback of the mouse pointer's "
"current position."
msgstr "某些桌面环境会以视觉提示显示鼠标指针的当前位置。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:398
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"KDE Plasma draws two circular lines moving around the mouse cursor.  Open "
"the `Desktop Effects` module:"
msgstr "KDE Plasma 会在鼠标光标周围绘制两条移动的圆形线条。打开 `桌面特效` 模块："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:402
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "% kcmshell6 kcm_kwin_effects\n"
msgstr "% kcmshell6 kcm_kwin_effects\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:407
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Enable the `_Track Mouse_` checkbox.  Draw circular lines by pressing `Meta` "
"+ `Ctrl` keys.  You can change the shortcut via the `_Configure_` button "
"related to `_Track Mouse_`."
msgstr "勾选 __跟踪鼠标__ 复选框。按下 `Meta` + `Ctrl` 键即可绘制圆形线条。你可以通过 __跟踪鼠标__ 旁边的 __配置__ 按钮更改快捷键。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:412
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"On keyboards where the `Meta` key is not present, it is usually replaced by "
"the `Super` key.  Refer to https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Meta_key and "
"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Super_key_(keyboard_button) for more "
"information."
msgstr "对于没有 `Meta` 键的键盘，通常使用 `Super` 键代替。更多信息请参阅 link:https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Meta_key[] 和 link:https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Super_key_(keyboard_button)[]。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:420
#, fuzzy
msgid "Xfce draws large red circles around the mouse pointer.  Type:"
msgstr "Xfce 会在鼠标指针周围绘制较大的红色圆圈。输入："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:424
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "% xfce4-find-cursor\n"
msgstr "% xfce4-find-cursor\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:427
#, fuzzy
msgid "The above command draws circles for a few seconds."
msgstr "上述命令会绘制圆圈并持续几秒钟。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:429
#, fuzzy
msgid "**Keyboard Shortcut**"
msgstr "**键盘快捷键**"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:433
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"XFCE allows to add a keyboard shortcut.  Circles are drawn for as long as "
"the shortcut keys are pressed.  To use the shortcut before enable the "
"feature then choose the key combination to bind to `xfce4-find-cursor`."
msgstr "XFCE 允许添加键盘快捷键。按住快捷键时，圆圈会持续绘制。要使用快捷键，请先启用此功能，然后选择要绑定到 `xfce4-find-cursor` 的组合键。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:435
#, fuzzy
msgid "Example to enable and bind `Ctrl` + `Super` + `k`:"
msgstr "启用功能并绑定 `Ctrl` + `Super` + `k` 的示例："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:439
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"xfconf-query -c accessibility -p /FindCursor -s true\n"
"xfconf-query -c xfce4-keyboard-shortcuts -n -t 'string' -p '/commands/custom/<Ctrl><Super>k' -s xfce4-find-cursor\n"
msgstr "xfconf-query -c accessibility -p /FindCursor -s true\nxfconf-query -c xfce4-keyboard-shortcuts -n -t 'string' -p '/commands/custom/<Ctrl><Super>k' -s xfce4-find-cursor\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:442
#, fuzzy
msgid "**Keyboard Shortcut via Dialogs**"
msgstr "**通过对话框设置键盘快捷键**"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:445
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Alternatively, you can achieve the same result via the XFCE configuration "
"dialogs.  First step, open the XFCE `_Accessibility_` dialog:"
msgstr "或者，你也可以通过 XFCE 配置对话框实现相同的效果。第一步，打开 XFCE 的 __辅助功能__ 对话框："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:449
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "% xfce4-accessibility-settings\n"
msgstr "% xfce4-accessibility-settings\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:452
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Click on `_Mouse_` tab and enable the `_Show location of pointer on "
"keypress_` checkbox."
msgstr "点击 __鼠标__ 选项卡，然后勾选 __按键时显示指针位置__ 复选框。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:454
#, fuzzy
msgid "Second step, open the XFCE `_Keyboard_` dialog:"
msgstr "第二步，打开 XFCE 的 __键盘__ 对话框："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:458
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "% xfce4-keyboard-settings\n"
msgstr "% xfce4-keyboard-settings\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/accessibility/lowvision/_index.adoc:463
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Click on `_Application Shortcuts_` tab.  Click on `_+ Add_` button, it opens "
"the `_Shortcut Command_` dialog.  Write _xfce4-find-cursor_ in the form, "
"then click on the `_OK_` button.  Choose a key combination to bind to `xfce4-"
"find-cursor` in the new dialog."
msgstr "点击 __应用程序快捷键__ 选项卡。点击 __+ 添加__ 按钮，打开 __快捷键命令__ 对话框。在输入框中输入 __xfce4-find-cursor__，然后点击 __确定__ 按钮。在新对话框中选择要绑定到 `xfce4-find-cursor` 的组合键。"
